  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "三种存储怎么选（session.py）",
      "items": [
        "InMemorySessionStore:394 默认、单进程、测试；拒绝旧序列覆盖",
        "JsonlSessionStore:435 每会话一文件、人类可读；保存是 tmp+os.replace 原子全量重写",
        "SqliteSessionStore:521 WAL+事务，保存=DELETE 全部事件再重插"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "恢复的两条路径与陷阱",
      "items": [
        "整会话恢复：store.get → SessionEvent.from_dict → migrate（session.py:366）",
        "管理器状态恢复：open_session 按 inbox.*/goal.*/budget.*/job.* 命名空间回放（runtime.py:948）",
        "Job 只恢复档案并标 INTERRUPTED，协程本体不恢复（runtime.py:700/684）",
        "replay() 只统计 turn 完成度，不重放执行（session.py:313）"
      ]
    }
  ]
